{"title": "Jar of Mystic Carrion's Lungs", "pageid": 19850, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion's_Lungs", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Canopic_Jar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Canopic_Jar_Icon.png/300px-Canopic_Jar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/0/0b/Canopic_Jar_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Lungs image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Canopic_Jar_Icon.png/300px-Canopic_Jar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Canopic_Jar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Jar of Mystic Carrion's Lungs</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A canopic jar containing Mystic Carrion's breathless lungs. If you put your ear close enough, you can make out an unholy rattling noise.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Graveyard's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\">Graveyard's</a> Mortuary cellar, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;1259&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;867</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The jar continues to sizzle with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">necrotic</span></a> energy, even if the rest of <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a> is defeated.</li>\n<li>When destroyed, the jar explodes and deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">8d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">DC</a> 10, to halve) on 4 m / 13 ft radius.</li>\n<li>If directly attacked and the attacker fails to destroy the jar, they take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">5</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>The hatch to the cellar is located at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;33&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;22</span>.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Brain\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Brain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Brain\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Brain\">Jar of Mystic Carrion's Brain</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Heart\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Heart\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Heart\">Jar of Mystic Carrion's Heart</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Liver\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Liver\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Canopic_Jar_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jar_of_Mystic_Carrion%27s_Liver\" title=\"Jar of Mystic Carrion's Liver\">Jar of Mystic Carrion's Liver</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3245/1000000\nPost‐expand include siz